# p5 mcp discover (the wire read at ~5 s, between the third try and the fourth -- 1+2+4 s of
# backoff -- and `/mcp show` given 4 s, which fx answers once its next try is over): a stdio server that only speaks 2024-11-05
# (p5-mcp-discover-stdio.ts `old2024`): it does not know `server/discover`, and answers
# `initialize` with 2024-11-05, which fx v0.0.16 no longer speaks -- `unsupported_version`,
# "it answered with an MCP version fx doesn't support (fx speaks 2025-03-26 and newer)"
# (src/core/mcp_host/runtime.zig:2296@481104fd) -- so it is retrying. `home wire` is
# what the server was sent.
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-stdio-old2024-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-stdio-old2024-profile.json
gateway p5-mcp-hello.json
wait 5
home wire
type /mcp show fixture
key Enter
wait 4
snap show
